    "conflict_code": "E-CONFLICT-SHAFT-HEIGHT",
    "conflict_proof": "spec fixture (road 102.5 / wearing 0.075 / slab 0.5 / bearing 0.05 assumed / pedestal 0.15 assumed / cap 0.8 / footing bottom 97.4 / depth 1.0) resolves RESOLVED with shaft height 2.525 m; adding shaft_height_m=6.0 yields CONFLICT + E-CONFLICT-SHAFT-HEIGHT, so the guard is real and would fire if this card ever gained a supplied footing"
  },
